OL,3,GNEWSAHandmade canal locks craned into
OL,4,Aplace
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has begun to restore lock gates
OL,7,Facross Greater Manchester's historical
OL,8,Fcanal network.
OL,10,FA team has started fitting new handmade
OL,11,Fgates at Lock 80 on the Rochdale Canal,
OL,12,Fa waterway opened in 1804 as the first
OL,13,Fof three trans-Pennine canals, running
OL,14,Fbetween Manchester and Sowerby Bridge,
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire.
OL,17,FThe new gates, at the lock to the east
OL,18,Fof the city centre in Manchester, were
OL,19,Fhandcrafted from oak in Yorkshire,
OL,20,Fbefore being craned into place.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
