OL,3,GNEWSAHandmade canal locks craned into
OL,4,Aplace
OL,5,
OL,6,FEach leaf of the upstream gate weighs
OL,7,Fone-and-a-half tonnes (1,500 kg), and
OL,8,Fthe downstream leaves weigh
OL,9,Ftwo-and-a-half tonnes (2,500 kg). They
OL,10,Freplace gates that were installed at
OL,11,Fthe turn of the millennium.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
